    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμείρομαι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desire, long
				for,</i>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμείρομαι</span>
			 in best codd. of <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				3.21
			</span></i> and I<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Thess.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ps.</u>
				62(63).2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμειρόμενοι περὶ παιδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4000.7
				</span></i>
			(<span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>, v.
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>JHS</u>
				38.152
			</span></i>). (Etym. unknown ; prob. not related to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμείρω</span> or to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείρομαι.</span>)</div>
